1
00:00:00,718 --> 00:00:03,437
Defence and tech news reaches you from everywhere:

2
00:00:03,437 --> 00:00:06,275
news sites, colleagues, and the group chat.

3
00:00:07,514 --> 00:00:10,094
Which of it is true? Which of it matters?

4
00:00:10,094 --> 00:00:12,800
Sorting it out by hand can take hours.

5
00:00:14,108 --> 00:00:18,024
Meet News Pulse. The three stories that matter, checked.

6
00:00:19,706 --> 00:00:23,199
It collects news from trusted defence and technology sources.

7
00:00:23,199 --> 00:00:27,323
An AI agent checks every story against independent and official sources.

8
00:00:27,323 --> 00:00:30,171
And only the three that matter reach you.

9
00:00:31,905 --> 00:00:34,008
Every story comes with a clear verdict,

10
00:00:34,008 --> 00:00:36,987
a two-line summary, and the reasons behind it.

11
00:00:41,619 --> 00:00:46,190
Got a forwarded link? Paste it in, and News Pulse checks it for you.

12
00:00:46,643 --> 00:00:48,368
This one? Likely fake.

13
00:00:48,368 --> 00:00:50,514
And it tells you why.

14
00:00:51,606 --> 00:00:53,893
It caught every planted fake in our tests.

15
00:00:53,893 --> 00:00:56,900
And it shows its reasoning, so you make the call.

16
00:00:57,908 --> 00:01:01,126
News Pulse. Three stories. Checked.

17
00:01:01,126 --> 00:01:03,300
In minutes, not hours.
